{"id":"n62266-1-8","stage":0,"title":"달 · 月","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62266-1-8-1","ko":"둥근 달이 떴네.","zh":"圆圆的月亮升起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"둥근","meaning":"圆，圆圆的","explanation":"둥글다：圆，圆圆的；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"둥글다","audio":"/audio/155ed9eaa3936402de81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50900","senseId":"1","lemma":"둥글다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둥근","audio":"/audio/9aa431da431313864901.mp3"}},{"text":"달이","meaning":"月，月亮，月球","explanation":"달：月，月亮，月球；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"1","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달이","audio":"/audio/8a92097caa828a252964.mp3"}},{"text":"떴네.","meaning":"离开","explanation":"뜨다：离开；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14456","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떴네","audio":"/audio/3dc2af5c78a85f06f56e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"155ed9eaa3936402","term":"둥글다","zh":"圆，圆圆的","audio":"/audio/155ed9eaa3936402de81.mp3","entryId":"50900","definition":"与圆圈或球的样子相同或相似。","pronunciation":["둥글다"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月，月亮，月球","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"晚上天空中出现的圆形明亮的发光天体。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"离开","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"14456","definition":"从原来的地方出发去别的地方。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e03a0a2b27e32f78f1cc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62266-1-8-2","ko":"벌써 보름인가?","zh":"已经到农历十五了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId"